# ============================================================================
# Zynx Linux package set
#
# This is a full XFCE desktop and installable system, not a minimal live
# rescue image.  The kernel is the official Arch Linux 'linux' package so
# linux-headers, DKMS and external kernel modules work out of the box.
# ============================================================================

